===

title: DivorcedDad
---
<<playMusic luxuryApt>>
<<camera Lobby>>
<<fadeIn 2>>
<<place Luna_Neutral>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral neutral>>
The delivery takes me to the Meridian District, home to the tech zillionaires and their corporate grifters. I approach a high-end luxury apartment tower and feel its tinted windows judge me as I park my motorbike right outside the entrance. 
<<place Nubs>>
<<expression Nubs wave_worried>>
Nubs: W-Wait up!
The glass lobby doors swing open, and I step inside to search for the owner of this sad bag of food.
A man in an outdated puffer vest and overpriced pants immediately walks over, waving at me.
<<place Dad_Neutral>>
<<expression Dad_Neutral neutral>>
???: Delivery for Benji?
Luna: Yeah.
<<expression Nubs neutral>>
Benji: Hey, you're from Root Town, right? 
He points at my motorbike's decal outside, which is a large gnarled tree. The symbol of Root Town.
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_neutral>>
Luna: (The guy’s got some crazy vision with those glasses…) 
<<expression Dad_Neutral happy>>
Benji: I'm from Root Town, too. HELLA!
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_annoyed>>
Luna: (And he’s hella cringe.)
I shove the order into the man’s hands and mark my order as complete on the SL0P app without another word.
But he lingers in the lobby. 
Luna: (It feels like he's REALLY desperate to say something, but has no one to say it to.)

-> Ignore him and leave
    <<set $badend += 1>>
    <<expression Dad_Neutral annoyed>>
    <<expression Nubs worried>>
    I turn around and leave. A job's a job, and I finished it.
    <<pose Luna_Neutral SceneSample_LunaFadeOut>>
    <<pose Nubs SceneSample_NubsFadeOut>>
    <<wait 1>>
    <<exit Luna_Neutral>>
    <<exit Nubs>>
    <<exit Dad_Neutral>>
    <<fadeOut 2>>
    <<camera BlackImage>>
    <<fadeIn 1>>
    //Only show a black screen and the dialogue box
    20 minutes later, I get a negative rating on the SL0P app and a violation as the cherry on top. It said the food looked like it'd been tampered with…
    Luna: …
    Nubs: I was hungry…
    But who cares? A person who lives in that building is rich enough to get more food without batting an eye…
    <<fadeOut 1>>
    <<stopMusic>>
    <<jump Bad_Outcome>>
-> Stare at him, expecting him to talk
    <<set $goodend += 1>>
    <<expression Dad_Neutral happy>>
    Benji: Giving me the Gen Z stare, huh?
    Luna: No one says that. That's like 40 years old.
    Luna: (Which is probably how old he is. Or even older.)
    Luna: What do you want?
    Benji: Oh, you’ve got time? Awesome! I'm glad the SL0P app still hires humans and gives their employees—er, contractors—paid breaks.
    Luna: We don’t. And time's ticking.

Benji: I just HAVE to tell someone. I'm going to get my first AGENTS implant tomorrow! I’m going all-in on eye surgery. Not even the best AGENTS glasses can beat an implant’s eyesight. 
Luna: (So that’s why his vision was so creepy good…)
Benji: My doc said I should be on an all-liquid diet for best results. But tomorrow, I'll be a new man who can finally stop eating sad soups!
He opens his delivery bag and frowns.
<<set $badend += 1>>
<<expression Dad_Neutral annoyed>>
Benji: Hey, what gives!? Where’s my side order of ion kelp crystals!?
<<expression Nubs happy>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_annoyed>>
I look down at my feet, where Nubs is. Glowing green goop is smeared across his screen.
<<expression Nubs worried>>
Nubs: Oops.
Luna: (How does he even eat?)
<<jump DivorcedDad_Surgery>>
===


